{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48792","headline":"邙山古意 · 薛曜","name":"邙山古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔掩佳城路，曾惊壑易迁。\n今接宜都里，翻疑海作田。\n镂鼎名应大，生金字不传。\n风飙吹白日，罗绮拭黄泉。\n象凤笙留国，成龙劒上天。\n长乐移新垄，咸阳失旧阡。\n川流徒漫漫，神理竟绵绵。\n伫见飞来鹤，沈嗟不学仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}